{"text": "If you are going to overthink, then overthink the positives. Overthink the best outcome.\n\nThe mind leans toward fear. It replays the past. It worries about a future that has not arrived. We carry tomorrow's weight before it is real.\n\nBut what if the mind were gently turned the other way? Overthink how peaceful it would feel if things quietly worked out. Friendships that nourish you. A place that feels like home. Work that agrees with your spirit.\n\nThis is not denying what is hard, my friend. It is choosing where the mind rests. When a dark thought arrives, notice it, thank it, and let it pass. Then return to what could go right.\n\nIf you will try this, write the word positives below, and follow me for the rest.\n\nBut attention is a muscle, and a tired mind cannot hold it for long. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "g", "o", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "o", "s", "i", "t", "i", "v", "e", "s", ".", " ", "O", "v", "e", "r", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "s", "t", " ", "o", "u", "t", "c", "o", "m", "e", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", " ", "m", "i", "n", "d", " ", "l", "e", "a", "n", "s", " ", "t", "o", "w", "a", "r", "d", " ", "f", "e", "a", "r", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "r", "e", "p", "l", "a", "y", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "s", "t", ".", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "o", "r", "r", "i", "e", "s", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", " ", "f", "u", "t", "u", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "a", "r", "r", "i", "v", "e", "d", ".", " ", "W", "e", " ", "c", "a", "r", "r", "y", " ", "t", "o", "m", "o", "r", "r", "o", "w", "'", "s", " ", "w", "e", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "b",